# S1 (plan.md step 3): build the TP4 G1 serving base from serving/tp4-g1 commit 1 (main + PR #30's in-image test fix +
# the image default general-prefix-tp4). No card is opened. Copy this over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a job commit
# ON TOP OF commit 1 (write it with Python, newline=chr(10)), commit, force-move and push the tag.
# C1 = the short sha of commit 1 (lowercase; the tag regex refuses capitals). The image is
# zot.thatch.local:5000/tt-vllm:qwen38-c2-tp4-g1-<C1>, local on the rig until pushed through the release lane (step 4).
# probe is deliberately NOT here: it runs in S2a, off the critical path, while the thin layer builds.
# drift is left out (a read-only report on the unchanged P8 base; the build's own G1 provenance enforces).
# Read: status's four-card block (4 boards, >= 4 free 1 GiB hugepages, df, no thatch-inference-* container), then
# build.log: "built zot.thatch.local:5000/tt-vllm:qwen38-c2-tp4-g1-<C1> sha256:...", "[G1] PASS: 0 problem(s)" and
# "[G1] (c) default: [QWEN-C2] profile general-prefix-tp4: vLLM argv".
# Duration: status 1-2 min, build 9-30 min (warm layers and kernel cache; v183/v196 took 9-10 min).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-g1-C1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
